# PROJECT: LEARNERPORT

## Complete Educational Content-Sharing Application

Build a complete, modern, premium, fully functional educational content-sharing web application named **Learnerport**.

The application must allow users to discover, upload, read, save, download, review, and share educational resources.

This is a real application project, not just a UI prototype.

Use your best judgment for architecture, UI/UX, database structure, component design, and implementation details while preserving all requirements defined below.

Do not repeatedly ask me to approve small design decisions. Make sensible decisions independently and implement the best practical solution.

IMPORTANT:

* Do not omit any mandatory feature.
* Do not create duplicate navigation options.
* Do not add unnecessary sections or excessive features.
* Do not generate nonfunctional buttons.
* Do not use fake analytics or fake user engagement.
* Do not claim integrations are working until they are configured and tested.

